azon.com/Tyranny-Twenty-Lessons-Twentieth-Century/dp/0804190119?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/Tyranny-Twenty-Lessons-Twentieth-Century/dp/0804190119?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Timothy Snyder</author></item><item><title>14: EMPIRE OF AI</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/du-prd/books/images/9780593657508.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;An examination of the disruptions made and resources taken by artificial intelligence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;New this week&lt;br&gt;Author: by Karen Hao&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Penguin Press</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593657500?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593657500?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Karen Hao</author></item><item><title>15: YET HERE I AM</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/du-prd/books/images/9781538767061.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;The MSNBC anchor and Pulitzer Prize-winning journalist describes how he embraced his identity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;New this week&lt;br&gt;Author: by Jonathan Capehart&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Grand Central</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/1538767066?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/1538767066?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Jonathan Capehart</author></item></channel></rss>